{"schema_version":1,"pipeline_version":"v6","run_id":"data-analysis-2026-01-02-20260102031541.-a8d09eab","generated_at":"2026-01-02T03:15:41.495Z","canonical_id":"huggingface:indonesian-nlp/wav2vec2-indonesian-javanese-sundanese","promptHash":"sha256:b1392483a713ba5f0b5c150a47b332385428022d853658cefeab4b05d654424d","summary_version":1,"status":"qualified","source":"huggingface","name":"wav2vec2-indonesian-javanese-sundanese","url":"https://huggingface.co/indonesian-nlp/wav2vec2-indonesian-javanese-sundanese","tags":["transformers","pytorch","wav2vec2","automatic-speech-recognition","audio","hf-asr-leaderboard","id","jv","robust-speech-event","speech","su","sun","dataset:mozilla-foundation/common_voice_7_0","dataset:openslr","dataset:magic_data","dataset:titml","license:apache-2.0","model-index","endpoints_compatible","region:us"],"stats":{"downloads_total":1967969,"likes_total":11},"metadata":{"license":"N/A","lang":"N/A","categories":{"capabilities":[],"scenes":[],"lifecycle":[]}},"summary_short":{"zh":"这是一个针对印尼语、爪哇语和巽他语进行微调的多语言语音识别模型，专门解决这些资源相对匮乏语言的准确转录难题。它基于Facebook的wav2vec 2.0架构，通过自监督预训练直接从原始音频中学习语音表征，再使用标注数据进行特定语言微调。开发者可通过Hugging Face的Transformers库快速加载该模型，用于音频文件转录、构建语音交互应用，或为这些语言创建语音数据集，在教育科技、无障碍服务和文化遗产数字化等领域具有实用价值。","en":"This is a multilingual speech recognition model fine-tuned on Indonesian, Javanese, and Sundanese audio data, addressing the challenge of accurate transcription for under-resourced languages. It builds on Facebook's wav2vec 2.0 architecture, which learns speech representations d…","es":"This is a multilingual speech recognition model fine-tuned on Indonesian, Javanese, and Sundanese audio data, addressing the challenge of accurate transcription for under-resourced languages. It builds on Facebook's wav2vec 2.0 architecture, which learns speech representations d…"},"summaries":{"en":"This is a multilingual speech recognition model fine-tuned on Indonesian, Javanese, and Sundanese audio data, addressing the challenge of accurate transcription for under-resourced languages. It builds on Facebook's wav2vec 2.0 architecture, which learns speech representations directly from raw audio through self-supervised pretraining, then fine-tunes with labeled data for specific languages. Researchers and developers can use it via Hugging Face's Transformers library to transcribe audio files, build voice interfaces, or create datasets for these languages, with potential applications in education, accessibility, and cultural preservation.","zh":"这是一个针对印尼语、爪哇语和巽他语进行微调的多语言语音识别模型，专门解决这些资源相对匮乏语言的准确转录难题。它基于Facebook的wav2vec 2.0架构，通过自监督预训练直接从原始音频中学习语音表征，再使用标注数据进行特定语言微调。开发者可通过Hugging Face的Transformers库快速加载该模型，用于音频文件转录、构建语音交互应用，或为这些语言创建语音数据集，在教育科技、无障碍服务和文化遗产数字化等领域具有实用价值。","es":"This is a multilingual speech recognition model fine-tuned on Indonesian, Javanese, and Sundanese audio data, addressing the challenge of accurate transcription for under-resourced languages. It builds on Facebook's wav2vec 2.0 architecture, which learns speech representations directly from raw audio through self-supervised pretraining, then fine-tunes with labeled data for specific languages. Researchers and developers can use it via Hugging Face's Transformers library to transcribe audio files, build voice interfaces, or create datasets for these languages, with potential applications in education, accessibility, and cultural preservation."},"provider":{"name":"deepseek-tri","version":"1.0.0","mode":"json_single"},"quality":{"score":0.92,"fallback":false,"length":{"en":649,"zh":220,"es":649},"warnings":["es_short:0"],"accepted_at":"2026-01-02T03:12:48.258Z"}}
